description.narrative:
Under Outcome 1, for example;
"A total of of 7000 people gained access to safe drinking water throguh the construction of 5 out of 27 water kiosks (19%) and the installation of 5 out of 25 yard-taps (20%) against the target of 39,500 people (18% of the target achieved to date)."
Under Outcome 2, for example;
"So far, 3442 container-based toilets are fully operatoinal (76% of the target achieved to date) with 100% of the pit waste being collected, treated and converted into end products"
Under Outcome 3, for example;
"A communication plan has been developed based on an assessment... and a total of 190,533 people was reached throgh awareness raising activities such as door-to-door visits and small group sessions (85% of the target achieved to date)"
Under Outcome 4, for example;
(Most funds were re-allocated from this Outcome, since some of it had already been funded from other sources). "A total of 20 WASH sector coordination meetings has been organised against the target of 6 meetings".
All quotes from the UNICEF progress report for 2020 (covering the period up til 19th of June 2021).
